{
  "name": "紙與墨 (Paper & Ink)",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "updated": "2026-09-18",
  "source_of_truth": "design/tokens.css",
  "note": "本檔是給機器與 AI 工具讀的鏡像。修改設計時先改此檔與 tokens.css，再跑 tools/check-design.mjs。",

  "color": {
    "light": {
      "bg": "#f7f5ee", "surface": "#fffefa", "surface-2": "#f1efe5",
      "text": "#253d36", "heading": "#183e35", "muted": "#617269",
      "line": "#d5ddd2", "line-strong": "#8d998f",
      "accent": "#14584a", "accent-weak": "#e4ebe4",
      "gold": "#b19b62", "gold-ink": "#7d6430",
      "warn": "#81562c", "danger": "#8c3a2e", "ok": "#2f6b45",
      "code-bg": "#f1efe5", "selection": "#e8e2cd", "shadow-panel": "0 8px 32px #183e3530"
    },
    "dark": {
      "bg": "#171d1a", "surface": "#1d2421", "surface-2": "#232b28",
      "text": "#e8e4d8", "heading": "#f4f1e6", "muted": "#9faba2",
      "line": "#2f3a35", "line-strong": "#5d6b64",
      "accent": "#7fc3a8", "accent-weak": "#1f2b27",
      "gold": "#b19b62", "gold-ink": "#c9ad72",
      "warn": "#d9a66a", "danger": "#e0907f", "ok": "#79c08d",
      "code-bg": "#131816", "selection": "#2e3a31", "shadow-panel": "0 8px 32px #00000066"
    }
  },

  "contrast_verified": {
    "method": "WCAG 2.1 相對亮度，2026-09-18 以程式驗證",
    "light": { "text/bg": 10.70, "heading/bg": 10.82, "muted/bg": 4.67,
               "accent/bg": 7.63, "gold-ink/bg": 5.15, "warn/bg": 5.83, "ok/bg": 5.62 },
    "dark":  { "text/bg": 13.46, "heading/bg": 15.13, "muted/bg": 7.19,
               "accent/bg": 8.37, "gold-ink/bg": 7.91, "warn/bg": 7.83, "ok/bg": 7.94 },
    "gold_on_paper": 2.49,
    "danger_light": 6.98, "danger_dark": 6.90,
    "note": "米紙上無法再容納比 --muted 更淡的第三層文字色（候選皆低於 4.5:1），因此層級改用字級與字重表達。"
  },

  "typography": {
    "serif": "\"Songti TC\",\"Noto Serif TC\",Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif",
    "sans": "\"PingFang TC\",\"Noto Sans TC\",\"Microsoft JhengHei\",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif",
    "mono": "ui-monospace,\"SFMono-Regular\",Menlo,Consolas,monospace",
    "rule": "標題用襯線，內文與介面用無襯線，程式碼用等寬。",
    "size": { "hero": "clamp(28px,3.2vw,44px)", "h1": "clamp(25px,2.6vw,34px)",
              "h2": "22px", "h3": "18px", "body": "16px", "sm": "14px", "xs": "12.5px" },
    "line_height": { "body": 1.8, "tight": 1.35 }
  },

  "layout": {
    "measure_read": "min(46vw,640px)",
    "measure_ui": "820px",
    "space": ["4px","8px","12px","16px","24px","32px","48px","64px"]
  },

  "shape": { "radius": { "sm": "3px", "md": "5px", "lg": "8px" },
             "shadow": "none", "shadow_exception": "--shadow-panel 僅供浮動面板（抽屜、彈窗）使用，其餘一律無陰影。", "note": "紙的語言＝近乎方正、無漸層。" },

  "motion": { "duration": "120ms", "easing": "ease" },

  "components": ["c-back","c-theme","c-card","c-tag","c-tag--on","c-tag--gold",
                 "c-note","c-note--warn","c-note--gold","c-note--danger","c-rule-gold","c-foot"],

  "rules": [
    "只使用語意變數（var(--accent)），不得在頁面 CSS 出現任何 #色碼。",
    "--gold 只能用於裝飾（細線、小圖飾）；任何承載資訊的金色一律用 --gold-ink。",
    "不使用漸層、不使用陰影。",
    "主題三態存於 localStorage['class-theme']，值為 system|light|dark，預設 system。",
    "每頁 <head> 必須有防閃爍腳本，且在樣式之前。",
    "非首頁必須有 .c-back 返回連結。",
    "站台頁以 <link> 引用 tokens.css；單檔教材內嵌其副本並標註版本。"
  ]
}
